Package: tidyPanel
Type: Package
Title: Import, Aggregate and Visualise Any Panel Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Carlos", family = "Morales", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "moralec@gmail.com")
Description: Declare which column is the individual and which is time, and
    'tidyPanel' recognises the id and time formats (dates, years, quarters,
    months, ISO weeks, Stata date formats, plain indices), organises the data,
    aggregates it in two stages (within individual over time, then across
    individuals by group) and draws publication-quality panel graphics.
    Generalises the plotting approach of 'wpa' and 'vivainsights'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: cli, dplyr, ggplot2, grid, rlang, scales, tibble, tidyr, tidyselect
Suggests: haven, ragg, readr, systemfonts, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
